---@field Enabled aws.appstream.BooleanObject Whether URL redirection is enabled for this direction.
---@field AllowedUrls? aws.appstream.UrlPatternList List of URL patterns that are allowed to be redirected. URLs matching these patterns will be redirected unless they also match a pattern in the denied list.
---@field DeniedUrls? aws.appstream.UrlPatternList List of URL patterns that are denied from redirection. This list takes precedence over the allowed list.

